  "body": "RTL text in URL is not as uncommon as many think. This API must support RTL and bidi text in URL and patterns. It's important because `:` is used for path parameters in the _beginning_ of the parameter name. In a RTL URL it would be a bit confusing unless it's fully specified. \r\n",
